# Whitelist: ignore everything, then allow only our own source and docs.
# Never add game files, decompiled code or Ghidra databases here.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!AGENTS.md
!README.md
!MODLOG.md
!STATUS.md
!Cargo.toml
